-- 登记: A02 | 语义: BOX-PRIM 的 POS 写回缺省原点 | expected_net: cancelled | restore 搭档: 本文件是 geom/box_pos_apply.mac 的 restore
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-GEOM-BOX-POS-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-BOX-PRIM
Q REF
Q NAME
Q POS WRT /*
POS E 0 N 0 U 0
Q POS WRT /*
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite geom/box_pos restore: BOX-PRIM POS E 0'
$P SUITE-GEOM-BOX-POS-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
